---
import {
  linkedin,
  linkedIcon,
  instagram,
  instagramIcon,
  uiIcon,
} from "../site/identity";

import Testimonial from "../components/sections/Testimonial.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Intro from "../components/Intro.astro";
import Chapter from "../components/Chapter.astro";
---

<Layout title="Meet Matt Adamou" active="about">
  <Intro
    eyebrow={"ABOUT AFIN"}
    description={
      "Financial coaching built around your goals, your circumstances, and a clearer way forward."
    }
  >
    <Fragment slot="title">
      A person in your corner.
      <br /> <em>Meet Matt Adamou.</em>
    </Fragment>
  </Intro>
  <section class="about about-page">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="portrait">
        <img
          src="/assets/matt-adamou.jpg"
          width="751"
          height="751"
          alt="Matt Adamou smiling"
        />
        <span>MATT ADAMOU / FINANCIAL COACH</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND AFIN</p>
        <h2>
          Personal guidance
          <br /> starts with a person.
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Matt is the financial coach behind Adamou Financial Consulting.
        </p>
        <p>
          He helps individuals, couples, and small businesses with customized
          financial strategies, personalized budgets, and debt payoff planning.
          Afin’s focus is a long-term partnership around your goals and
          financial growth.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-links">
          <a href={linkedin}>
            <Fragment set:html={linkedIcon} />
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          <a href={instagram}>
            <Fragment set:html={instagramIcon} />
            Afin on Instagram
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section values" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <div class="values-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHAT AFIN STANDS FOR</p>
      <h2 id="values-title">
        Your life sets
        <br /> <em>the direction.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Financial guidance should connect to something that matters to you.
      </p>
      <p class="values-principle">
        Your priorities are the starting point. Together, give your next steps a
        purpose you recognize.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="values-list">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHAT PROGRESS COULD LOOK LIKE</p>
      {[
        [
          "wallet",
          "A calmer month.",
          "A clearer view of everyday spending, with a budget shaped around your life.",
        ],
        [
          "compass",
          "Less uncertainty around debt.",
          "Understand your options and find a practical next step that fits your circumstances.",
        ],
        [
          "target",
          "More room for your goals.",
          "Make space for what you’ve been putting off—and connect today’s choices to what comes next.",
        ],
      ].map(([icon, title, description]) => (
        <>
          <article>
            <span class="values-icon">
              <Fragment set:html={uiIcon(icon)} />
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{description}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
  <Chapter label={"THE WORKING RELATIONSHIP"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Practical.
      <br /> Personal.
      <br /> Built together.
    </Fragment>
    <div class="reading-cards">
      <article>
        <span class="card-icon">
          <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("search")} />
        </span>
        <h3>Clarity before complexity</h3>
        <p>
          Start with what is happening today and what you want to understand
          better. A useful next step should make sense in your everyday life.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="card-icon">
          <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("person")} />
        </span>
        <h3>Room for your circumstances</h3>
        <p>
          Your responsibilities, timing, and goals shape the conversation. You
          don’t need to arrive with everything organized.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span class="card-icon">
          <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("compass")} />
        </span>
        <h3>A longer view</h3>
        <p>
          Afin’s focus on partnership connects today’s financial choices with
          the direction you want to grow.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Chapter>
  <Testimonial />
  <Chapter label={"GET TO KNOW THE FIT"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      You can start
      <br /> with a question.
    </Fragment>
    <p>
      Choosing a coach is personal, too. Ask Matt how his approach relates to
      your situation, what working together could involve, and how scope and
      fees would be agreed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Explore
      <a href="/approach/">the coaching approach</a>
      for a closer look at the first conversation, or
      <a href="/services/">browse the services</a>
      to see where you might start.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/contact/">
      Introduce yourself to Matt
    </a>
  </Chapter>
</Layout>
